Ticket number: NMG-0047
Affected user: Jane Cooper (jcooper@NMG.com)
Issue reported: Unable to access HR shared resources. Desktop policies and mapped
drives differ from teammates.
Root cause: After checking the user profile, I noticed the account was in the wrong OU
(Operations), which caused it to receive incorrect permissions.
Fix applied: To resolve this, I moved the user to the HR OU, removed them from the old
group, and added them to the correct one so they would have proper access.
Verification: I verified the changes in Active Directory Users and Computers by checking
that the user is now in the HR OU. I also reviewed the 'Member Of' tab to make sure they
were removed from the old group and properly added to the HR group.
